  "ruleText": "Lot 8002.21 “Racing secretary” means the race official primarily responsible for planning and arranging racing schedules, assigning handicapped weights to horses, and maintaining complete records of all races.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Lot 8000) #12544, eff 6-1-18",
